sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Planner worker
    participant R as Runtime coordinator
    participant T as Timeline store / sampler
    participant E as ExecutionEpisode
    participant N as NavigationMode
    T->>T: sample reaches certified BACKUP interval
    T->>E: exact-generation sampled role
    W-->>R: late nominal result
    R->>R: recheck timeline, request, episode and leases
    alt result superseded or emergency certificate fails
    R->>E: discard stale result or failClosed(Px4Hold)
    else certified measured stop
    R->>E: CertifiedStopObserved / stopped recovery
    R->>W: plan from measured rest or retry
    end
    R-->>N: NavigationCommand / status on separate ROS path
    Note over R,N: Runtime and PX4 adapter recovery clocks/identities are separate.
